#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:1
#: a211363fbcd742efb3564b6c8413f66c
msgid "查找最大误差结构（Find Max Error Point）"
msgstr "Find Structures with the Largest Errors"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:3
#: f76f54a1261248c599914d0626e508f5
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:5
#: 89ba9b294e9c4e008dc178c847255edb
msgid ""
"从当前图对应的误差指标中选出最大的前 `N` 个结构，用于快速定位最需要复核的标签、 异常构型或训练集缺口。结果依赖当前子图，切换 "
"energy、force 或 virial 后含义不同。"
msgstr "Select the top `N` structures by the error metric represented in the current plot. Use this to locate labels, anomalous configurations, or training-set gaps that most need review. The meaning depends on the active subplot and changes between energy, force, and virial views."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:8
#: aca12fd065454c81933368c8874ad0af
msgid "排名原理"
msgstr "Ranking Method"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:10
#: 95ada07fd22d4958a22b37d2cd5a709b
msgid "当前图中 x 轴是 NEP 预测值，y 轴是参考值（通常为 DFT）。对图中第 $i$ 行数据， 程序按当前子图包含的分量计算绝对误差和："
msgstr "In the current plot, x is the NEP prediction and y is the reference value, usually from DFT. For row $i$, the program sums the absolute errors over the components shown by the active subplot:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:13
#: 0bc935f67924403fbddedd79f414ff35
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"e_i=\\sum_{k\\in C}\\left|y_{ik}-x_{ik}\\right|,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"e_i=\\sum_{k\\in C}\\left|y_{ik}-x_{ik}\\right|,\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:17
#: f2c75d5df8b34f6998ed2131a6bf7342
msgid ""
"其中 $C$ 是当前图实际参与比较的列。例如能量图通常每个结构只有一行；力图中一个结构 会有多个原子行。程序先按 $e_i$ "
"从大到小排序，再把行映射回结构编号并去重，直到得到 前 $N$ 个不同结构。因此在力图中，它回答的是“至少有一个原子分量误差很大的结构”， "
"不是按结构平均 RMSE 排名。"
msgstr "Here $C$ is the set of columns actually compared in the current plot. An energy plot usually has one row per structure, whereas a force plot has several atomic rows for one structure. Rows are sorted by decreasing $e_i$, mapped back to structure indices, and deduplicated until `N` distinct structures remain. In a force plot, this therefore finds structures with at least one large atomic-component error; it is not a ranking by per-structure mean RMSE."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:22
#: 99b42d24a9af4189ae6ef0af2e1f9ed1
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6213
#: 5f754809735f43feb39ab3bb04953b5c
msgid "输入控件：`结构数`（整数 `N`）。"
msgstr "Control: `Number of structures` (integer `N`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6214
#: 40738c2bba8346f18610ccd2d40405d2
msgid "默认值：`widget.max_error_value`（缺省 `10`）。"
msgstr "Default: `widget.max_error_value` (fallback `10`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:6215
#: 6959b176193f49029b5f670bab2b0dbb
msgid "执行结果：选中当前轴上误差最大的前 `N` 个结构。"
msgstr "Result: select the top `N` structures with the largest errors on the current axes."

