#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:29
#: b38ac63720be4bac930f14f72126dc46
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-max-error.md:31
#: 7f4c94a449c94481a66c2086ac5abf5c
msgid ""
"不要仅凭误差排名删除结构。点开选中的结构，结合 `Config_type`、几何和 DFT 来源判断： "
"它可能是坏标签，也可能是训练集中真正缺少的重要边界构型。"
msgstr "Do not delete structures solely from their error ranking. Inspect each selected structure together with its `Config_type`, geometry, and DFT provenance: it may contain a bad label, or it may be an important boundary configuration missing from the training set."
